WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
Graph Edit Networks close this gap by predicting an
explicit,

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.792
human-readable edit script.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:11.396
The original work claims it beats every baseline,
reaches perfect accuracy on trees,

00:00:11.476 --> 00:00:16.868
and scales to large graphs, but those claims rest
on briefly-described benchmarks,

00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:19.670
where independent reproduction adds value.
